# w2_l2b "Brute's Den" from '@' to the exit on Beginner (ticks:KEYS, keys L R U D F K), with the AXE a run carries
# from Canopy Village when it skips the hammer of Echo Caverns. The axe is thrown (a high strike throws it at head
# height), so the hero fights from two body lengths away; each throw locks him for 6 ticks.
# The bone tunnel: the inset spot (it holds a heart), drumsticks, meat, a heart that waits for later, the ribs
# (a hidden spot), the checkpoint and two spots in the floor by the sign.
